---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Topbar from '../components/Topbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Sound Dip"
  description="How Sound Dip collects, uses, and protects your information."
  canonical="/privacy"
>
  <main>
    <Topbar />
    <article class="static-page">
      <header class="static-head">
        <div class="static-num">§</div>
        <h1>Privacy <em>Policy.</em></h1>
        <p class="static-updated">Last updated: 2026</p>
      </header>

      <section class="prose">
        <p>Sound Dip ("we", "us") operates sounddip.com. This policy explains what information we collect, why we collect it, and the choices you have.</p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p><strong>Information you send us.</strong> When you submit a listing or contact us, you may provide your name, email address, and details about your practice or question. We use this only to respond to you and, for submissions, to verify and publish the listing you asked us to add.</p>
        <p><strong>Usage data.</strong> Like most websites, we may collect standard, non-identifying analytics (such as pages visited and approximate location) to understand how the site is used and to improve it. This does not identify you personally.</p>

        <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
        <p>We use Google AdSense to display advertising. AdSense and other Google services may use cookies or similar technologies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other sites. You can opt out of personalized advertising through <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Ads Settings</a>, or visit <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a> to learn about interest-based advertising and your choices.</p>

        <h2>How we use information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect to operate and improve the directory, respond to your messages, publish listings you submit, and prevent abuse of the submit and verification forms. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

        <h2>Third-party links</h2>
        <p>The directory links to practitioners' own websites and booking platforms. Those sites are operated by third parties and have their own privacy practices. We are not responsible for their content or policies.</p>

        <h2>Data retention</h2>
        <p>We keep contact and submission information only as long as needed to respond to you and maintain the directory. You may ask us to correct or remove your information at any time.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:hello@sounddip.com">hello@sounddip.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
    <Footer />
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .static-page { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 140px 6vw 80px; }
  .static-head { margin-bottom: 56px; }
  .static-num { font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; font-size: 48px; color: var(--clay); line-height: 0.8; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .static-head h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(44px, 6vw, 72px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -2px; color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 16px; font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144; }
  .static-head h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--clay); }
  .static-updated { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .prose { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink); font-variation-settings: "opsz" 72; }
  .prose h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--ink); margin-top: 56px; margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144; }
  .prose p { margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--ink-mid); }
  .prose a { color: var(--clay); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .prose a:hover { color: var(--clay-d); }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .static-page { padding: 100px 6vw 60px; } .prose { font-size: 17px; } }
</style>
